 accounting reviews."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":8,"name":"EMI calculator","url":"https://invoicewala.shop/tools/emi-calculator","description":"Calculate loan EMI, interest and repayment totals for business purchases."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":9,"name":"Tax calculator","url":"https://invoicewala.shop/tools/tax-calculator","description":"Calculate custom tax amounts for service bills, purchase orders and estimates."}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Are these tools free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The calculators and converters are public. Saving invoices, reports and history requires an InvoiceWala account."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the GST calculator built for India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. It supports common GST rates, inclusive and exclusive GST, and CGST/SGST or IGST splits."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I turn a result into an invoice?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. High-intent tools include InvoiceWala CTAs so you can move from calculation to invoice, PDF, reminders and reporting."}}]}]0:{"P":null,"c":["","tools"],"q":"","i":false,"f":[[["",{"children":["tools",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",16],[["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/chunks/0kz_nk3zu--bk.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefined"}],["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/0g65zv~fun4x7.js","async":true,"nonce":"$undefined"}],["$","script","script-1",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js","async":true,"nonce":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"h-full antialiased","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"min-h-full bg-slate-50 text-slate-950 antialiased dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-50","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"src":"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-WVY8QGQWCV","strategy":"afte